# Billing — domain model

The vocabulary this product bills in. Terms are tagged `.glossary`;
decisions arrive from `docs/decisions/` and are never restated here, so
there is exactly one place each of them is written down.

## Terms

<hick:copy id="term-execution-minute" class="glossary">
**Execution minute** — wall-clock time a document's cells spend inside an
executor, measured from container start to the last cell's exit. Not CPU
time, and not billed when a run is served from cache without starting a
container.
</hick:copy>

<hick:copy id="term-allowance" class="glossary">
**Allowance** — a plan's execution minutes per calendar month, reset on the
first of the month UTC. Distinct from a *quota*, which we do not use: an
allowance is refused when exhausted, never queued or throttled.
</hick:copy>

## Decisions this model rests on

